{
  "$comment": "One week at a small shop. Days are Mon..Sun (add \"week\": 2 for a fortnight), or use \"date\": \"2026-11-09\" everywhere instead. A shift that ends before it starts runs past midnight. needs maps a skill to how many people with it the shift must have; each person fills one need. \"any\" matches everyone. An assignment can be a plain id, or {\"id\": ..., \"as\": skill} to fix the role. rules left out default to 11 h rest, 6 days in a row and 12 h a day.",
  "rules": { "min_rest_hours": 11, "max_consecutive_days": 6, "max_hours_per_day": 12 },
